{"name":"Black Cherry","hex":"#2c1620","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"black cherry","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A tree of species Prunus serotina"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/black_cherry"}],"entries":[{"title":"Prunus serotina","blocks":[{"text":"Prunus serotina, commonly called black cherry, wild black cherry, rum cherry, or mountain black cherry, is a New World deciduous tree or shrub in the rose family, Rosaceae. Despite its common names, it is not very closely related to commonly cultivated cherries."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0d/Amerikaanse_vogelkers_Prunus_serotina_closeup.jpg/330px-Amerikaanse_vogelkers_Prunus_serotina_closeup.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prunus_serotina"},{"title":"Prunus avium","blocks":[{"text":"Prunus avium, commonly called wild cherry, sweet cherry or gean, is a species of cherry, a flowering plant in the rose family, Rosaceae. It is native to western Eurasia and naturalized elsewhere. It is an ancestor of P. cerasus."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/49/Prunus_avium_fruit.jpg/330px-Prunus_avium_fruit.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prunus_avium"},{"title":"Black Cherry (Goldfrapp album)","blocks":[{"text":"Black Cherry is the second studio album by English electronic music duo Goldfrapp, released on 23 April 2003 by Mute Records. It marked a departure from the ambient sound of their debut album, Felt Mountain (2000), incorporating glam rock and synth-pop music; inspirations were Spanish disco group Baccara and Swedish techno artist Håkan Lidbo. The album was met with positive reviews, with many critics complimenting its blend of retro and modern electropop music."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/5/5b/GoldfrappBlackCherry.PNG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Cherry_(Goldfrapp_album)"},{"title":"Cherry","blocks":[{"text":"A cherry is the fruit of many plants of the genus Prunus, and is a fleshy drupe."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/Cherry_season_%2848216568227%29.jpg/330px-Cherry_season_%2848216568227%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cherry"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Prunus_serotina_kz11.jpg/250px-Prunus_serotina_kz11.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Prunus_serotina_kz11.jpg/500px-Prunus_serotina_kz11.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d4/Prunus_serotina_kz11.jpg/250px-Prunus_serotina_kz11.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APrunus_serotina_kz11.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/PrunusSerotinaBark.jpg/250px-PrunusSerotinaBark.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/PrunusSerotinaBark.jpg/500px-PrunusSerotinaBark.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/PrunusSerotinaBark.jpg/250px-PrunusSerotinaBark.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APrunusSerotinaBark.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d7/Prunus-serotina-flowers.jpg/250px-Prunus-serotina-flowers.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm